1
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:48,280
What are you doing?

2
00:01:50,739 --> 00:01:51,599
Was it you?

3
00:01:55,620 --> 00:01:56,280
What?

4
00:01:57,900 --> 00:02:00,099
Ready to kill your own father

5
00:02:00,859 --> 00:02:02,459
