6
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:04,599
Hard to believe

7
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,840
a powerful general

8
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,620
would sink so low to

9
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:10,819
target a

10
00:02:10,819 --> 00:02:12,520
sick, helpless woman.

11
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,979
Anyone who threatens

12
00:02:14,979 --> 00:02:15,840
my boy's future

13
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:19,099
won't live to see tomorrow.

14
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:25,039
Then mark my words,

15
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,360
General.

16
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:30,900
If anything happens to her,

17
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:32,639
you can consider me

18
00:02:33,460 --> 00:02:35,000
