19
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:37,560
Watch your tongue!

20
00:02:38,159 --> 00:02:38,860
Pingjun is

21
00:02:38,860 --> 00:02:40,340
my lawful wife.

22
00:02:41,060 --> 00:02:42,759
Whatever happens,

23
00:02:43,539 --> 00:02:44,659
I will stand by her.

24
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,000
You wanna take her life?

25
