26
00:02:53,099 --> 00:02:53,900
Changxuan!

27
00:03:01,539 --> 00:03:03,060
Stop this, both of you!

28
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:03,740
Can't we just

29
00:03:03,740 --> 00:03:05,099
- talk this through?
- Let go!

30
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:07,639
Does it have to come to blood?

31
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,060
Take it back!

32
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:11,379
Dad,

33
00:03:12,659 --> 00:03:13,599
