34
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,740
I'm not my brother.

35
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:21,639
I call the shots in my own life!

36
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,300
Darling...

37
00:03:31,060 --> 00:03:33,039
