43
00:03:45,139 --> 00:03:46,699
Stop feeding his delusion!

44
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,939
Don't you see what's at stake?

45
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,639
Marrying her

46
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,840
ruins his future!

47
00:03:53,139 --> 00:03:56,900
It will tear down everything we've built!

48
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:58,219
We destroyed

49
00:03:58,219 --> 00:03:59,300
one son already.

50
00:03:59,300 --> 00:04:01,180
Are we gonna do it again?

51
00:04:03,539 --> 00:04:04,419
We did nothing wrong!

52
00:04:06,900 --> 00:04:09,039
All these years, I've wondered...

53
00:04:10,099 --> 00:04:11,259
What if we hadn't

54
00:04:11,599 --> 00:04:13,300
pushed Mingxuan

55
00:04:13,300 --> 00:04:14,860
into the military?

56
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:15,979
What if we'd let him

57
00:04:15,979 --> 00:04:18,160
follow his own dreams

58
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:19,560
and be free from

59
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:22,160
that arranged marriage?

60
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:24,240
Maybe he'd

61
00:04:24,939 --> 00:04:27,060
still be here.

62
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,459
He might

63
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,420
not have lived up

64
00:04:32,699 --> 00:04:34,959
to your expectations,

65
00:04:35,399 --> 00:04:37,040
but at least he'd still

66
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,699
be with us.

67
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:42,300
Mingxuan's death...

68
00:04:42,819 --> 00:04:44,040
Isn't that

69
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,720
blood on our hands?

70
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:50,360
I'm looking out for him.

71
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:51,759
I'm handing him

72
00:04:51,759 --> 00:04:53,060
