73
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,560
Looking out for him?

74
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:58,060
Is that what he really wants?

75
00:04:59,819 --> 00:05:00,860
Remember,

76
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:02,560
you're

77
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,920
his father first,

78
00:05:03,920 --> 00:05:06,220
