79
00:05:06,699 --> 00:05:09,259
I can't lose another son!

80
00:05:10,800 --> 00:05:12,420
Let him go.

81
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:14,920
Let him choose his life,

82
00:05:15,420 --> 00:05:16,839
