83
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:45,579
Pingjun... it's official.

84
00:06:49,279 --> 00:06:50,319
We're married.

85
00:06:52,620 --> 00:06:53,819
From this day forward,

86
00:06:54,699 --> 00:06:56,100
