101
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,659
You remember that one, don't you?

102
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,600
Ten-hut!

103
00:09:15,519 --> 00:09:16,320
At ease.

104
00:10:31,580 --> 00:10:32,059
Mr. Jin!

105
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,480
Care for a hand, Mr. Jin?

106
00:10:52,820 --> 00:10:53,799
Director, your letter.

107
00:10:59,519 --> 00:10:59,879
Alright.

108
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:18,700
It's been snowing

109
00:11:18,700 --> 00:11:19,700
all night.

110
00:11:23,139 --> 00:11:24,220
This is our very first

111
00:11:24,220 --> 00:11:25,299
