116
00:11:38,039 --> 00:11:38,740
Is it alright?

117
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,639
Let's eat.

118
00:12:46,779 --> 00:12:47,620
Wanxuan,

119
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:49,759
Qixuan...

120
00:12:50,620 --> 00:12:51,299
Dig in!

121
00:13:14,659 --> 00:13:15,519
Extra! Extra!

122
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:18,039
Cheng Jun bought his way to power!

123
00:13:18,340 --> 00:13:19,899
Impeached and thrown outta office!

124
00:13:22,139 --> 00:13:23,299
Extra! Extra!

125
00:13:23,559 --> 00:13:25,480
Cheng Jun stole the presidency!

126
00:13:25,799 --> 00:13:27,559
Impeached and ousted in disgrace!

127
00:13:28,019 --> 00:13:29,720
Extra! Extra!

128
00:13:29,919 --> 00:13:31,399
Extra! Extra!

129
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:33,360
Cheng Jun stole the presidency!

130
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:35,019
Impeached and ousted in disgrace!

131
00:13:35,220 --> 00:13:35,740
Hah!

132
00:13:37,340 --> 00:13:37,860
Sir,

133
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:39,799
Changxuan saw this coming

134
00:13:40,139 --> 00:13:41,740
