144
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:02,740
I've got great faith in

145
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,480
Changxuan's wit.

146
00:14:05,960 --> 00:14:07,559
He may be second-in-command now,

147
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:08,779
but

148
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:11,080
the mantle will

149
00:14:11,879 --> 00:14:12,879
fall on him.

150
00:14:13,740 --> 00:14:15,279
You old-timers need to

151
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:17,299
