182
00:15:30,100 --> 00:15:32,019
Quite the royal treatment, Mr. Governor.

183
00:15:33,419 --> 00:15:34,940
I am truly humbled.

184
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,659
All these years,

185
00:15:39,659 --> 00:15:41,059
and this is the first time

186
00:15:41,059 --> 00:15:43,019
we're having a private feast.

187
00:15:45,059 --> 00:15:46,419
Try the lamb.

188
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:47,919
Fresh as can be.

189
00:15:50,259 --> 00:15:51,879
I brought a little appetizer

190
00:15:52,419 --> 00:15:55,080
for the party.

191
00:15:59,580 --> 00:16:00,940
Yu Changxuan met

192
00:16:01,139 --> 00:16:02,559
with the Germans today.

193
00:16:03,220 --> 00:16:04,779
He's trying to acquire their steel mill.

194
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:08,259
He's stepping up

195
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:10,460
arms production.

196
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:13,879
The cards are on the table.

197
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:15,720
Let's not waste time with riddles.

198
00:16:17,220 --> 00:16:18,019
Mr. Governor,

199
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:20,980
I'd like to see us

200
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,679
on the same side,

201
00:16:23,980 --> 00:16:26,080
sharing our bread,

202
00:16:26,779 --> 00:16:28,259
