203
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:35,720
A pact begins with trust.

204
00:16:39,679 --> 00:16:41,379
A pact begins with profit.

205
00:16:43,220 --> 00:16:44,440
Sixty-forty on the gold mine,

206
00:16:44,840 --> 00:16:45,679
in your favor.

207
00:16:47,059 --> 00:16:47,860
You take

208
00:16:48,460 --> 00:16:50,200
the customs

209
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:52,200
and the trade routes.

210
00:16:55,879 --> 00:16:56,419
To us!

211
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:04,900
With Cheng ousted from power,

212
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:07,180
his air fleet

213
00:17:07,259 --> 00:17:08,160
fled to the

214
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,680
Tianjin concessions.

215
00:17:10,200 --> 00:17:11,059
Last night,

216
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:12,799
Wu Zuoxiao took advantage of

217
00:17:12,799 --> 00:17:13,400
the elevated position

218
00:17:13,859 --> 00:17:14,920
and our newly

219
00:17:15,420 --> 00:17:17,079
deployed AA batteries to force down

220
00:17:17,480 --> 00:17:18,500
