221
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,579
We seized the bombers,

222
00:17:20,819 --> 00:17:21,839
their ordnance,

223
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:22,920
and

224
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:23,900
maintenance gear.

225
00:17:24,119 --> 00:17:24,740
Better yet,

226
00:17:24,740 --> 00:17:26,180
we found their secret contracts

227
00:17:26,819 --> 00:17:27,819
with Italian arms dealers.

228
00:17:28,619 --> 00:17:29,420
Our

229
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:30,779
crew

230
00:17:30,779 --> 00:17:32,319
will strip the engines

231
00:17:32,779 --> 00:17:34,019
from those

232
00:17:34,019 --> 00:17:35,019
Fiat bombers,

233
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,420
modifying them

234
00:17:36,640 --> 00:17:37,220
for

235
00:17:37,220 --> 00:17:38,460
freezing conditions.

236
00:17:38,799 --> 00:17:40,299
We'll also convert

237
00:17:40,299 --> 00:17:41,819
our service rifles

238
00:17:42,019 --> 00:17:43,259
into aircraft guns

239
00:17:43,460 --> 00:17:45,019
to make up for our lack of firepower.

240
00:17:46,259 --> 00:17:46,900
Yes, sir!

241
00:18:46,059 --> 00:18:47,279
She's awake...

242
00:18:48,059 --> 00:18:49,160
She opened her eyes!

243
00:18:49,859 --> 00:18:50,960
She's awake!

244
00:18:52,019 --> 00:18:53,079
She's awake!

245
00:19:04,279 --> 00:19:04,900
Sir,

246
00:19:06,359 --> 00:19:07,099
we tracked down

247
00:19:07,099 --> 00:19:08,099
the dealer

248
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:09,500
selling defective weapons.

249
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,119
He fled to Heihe.

250
00:19:11,440 --> 00:19:12,839
We'll bag him shortly.

251
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:14,799
Guy went underground

252
00:19:15,079 --> 00:19:16,480
