253
00:19:18,380 --> 00:19:19,480
Now he's resurfaced...

254
00:19:20,380 --> 00:19:21,059
Bring him in alive?

255
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,279
Yeah.

256
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:26,480
We've got things in hand here, sir.

257
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:28,180
Go home and be with your wife.

258
00:19:30,599 --> 00:19:31,119
You guys

259
00:19:31,119 --> 00:19:32,359
took a lot off my plate lately.

260
00:19:32,980 --> 00:19:33,779
I can't thank you enough.

261
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:41,619
Headquarters,

262
00:19:41,619 --> 00:19:42,640
