263
00:19:44,299 --> 00:19:45,039
For you, sir.

264
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:52,440
Speak.

265
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:53,900
Master, it's me!

266
00:19:54,019 --> 00:19:55,059
She's awake!

267
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:43,380
