268
00:20:43,779 --> 00:20:44,779
[I ask that you]

269
00:20:44,779 --> 00:20:46,019
[leave me alone.]

270
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:48,140
[And what if I won't?]

271
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:53,160
[Did you learn nothing]

272
00:20:55,200 --> 00:20:56,700
