273
00:21:19,819 --> 00:21:21,279
I think Master Yu is back.

274
00:21:26,839 --> 00:21:27,539
Master.

275
00:21:28,259 --> 00:21:28,900
Master.

276
00:21:36,900 --> 00:21:37,700
You're back with me...

277
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,259
Who are you?

278
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:50,519
Master,

279
00:21:50,660 --> 00:21:51,339
she's been like this

280
