285
00:22:19,940 --> 00:22:20,900
It's me, Yu Changxuan!

286
00:22:33,099 --> 00:22:33,680
Pingjun...

287
00:22:35,220 --> 00:22:36,339
Yu... Changxuan...

288
00:22:38,220 --> 00:22:38,700
Pingjun!

289
00:22:38,700 --> 00:22:39,640
What's wrong?

290
00:22:40,680 --> 00:22:41,380
Ma'am!

291
00:22:41,660 --> 00:22:42,480
It's alright.

292
00:22:42,779 --> 00:22:43,839
